{
  "worlds": [
    {
      "id": "quarry",
      "order": 2,
      "name": "The Quarry",
      "stages": [
        "quarry-road",
        "cut",
        "shaft",
        "ledger"
      ],
      "castle": "shaft",
      "statue": "E"
    }
  ],
  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "quarry.road",
      "world": "quarry",
      "title": "Clear the road south",
      "kind": "main",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "cut",
          "objective": "Slide the road: `4x` on the gravel, then down the shaft.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "trigger",
            "trigger": "quarry.through"
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "river",
          "objective": "Cross the river: `5r=` from the bank.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "trigger",
            "trigger": "quarry.far"
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "south",
          "objective": "Climb the stairs to the gate on the far bank.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "stage-cleared",
            "stage": "quarry-road"
          },
          "then": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "openingStage": "quarry-road",
  "openingQuests": [],
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "quarry-road.intro",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The Quarry. You need the road south, and the\nUnwriter buried it. Rubble, then a river."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.ash",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Half the cut came down. No road, no tolls, no\npay for my crew. Clear it, will you?",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "name": "Foreman Ash",
          "text": "Cut too much? `:e!` puts the quarry back.\nNo shame. I've done it twice. Today."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The shaft drops onto a boulder. Stand on the\ngravel, press `4x`: the road slides under it."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "quarry.knows-x",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.ash-again",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "My crew's playing cards in the tents. Loudly.\nPay day can't come soon enough.",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The shaft drops onto a boulder. Stand on the\ngravel, press `4x`: the road slides under it."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.kit",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Ash says the Unwriter walked straight through\nthe cut. Didn't even stop. Rude. I want my bunk.",
          "name": "Kit"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.kit-later",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "The wall whispered last night. What if we're\nalready gone? Ignore me. Long shift.",
          "name": "Kit"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "scribe",
          "text": "Page 2. My brother liked machines, so I wrote\nhim a quarry. Cranes, carts, a very loud river."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Stand on the bank. Press `5r=`: five planks.\nDeleting the water drags the stairs away."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "quarry.knows-r",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.through",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The river. A note is pinned by the water.\nRead it before you cross."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.crack",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Through a crack in the rock: this same quarry,\nbut emptier. No road. No tents. No one."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry-road.death-hint",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Road: `4x` on the gravel slides it west.\nRiver: `5r=` from the bank."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry-road.end",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The road south is open. Somewhere below,\nsomeone is laying stone, row on row."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    }
  ],
